#!RuleTest
#test FDA-SD0058-E expect=noViolation domain=SE
#note "A SEND SE dataset carrying only model variables: nothing is reported. The SEND CO/DM/SE arm of FDA-SD0058 keeps the plain ladder because the SENDIG grants additional Timing variables to the general-observation-class domains only."
#library standard=sendig version=3-1
#library model-column-order SE STUDYID DOMAIN USUBJID SESEQ ETCD ELEMENT SESTDTC SEENDTC SEUPDES
dataset SE
col STUDYID type=Char
col DOMAIN type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col SESEQ type=Num
col ETCD type=Char
col SESTDTC type=Char
col SEENDTC type=Char
---
S1 | SE | 001 | 1 | SCRN | 2012-07-06 | 2012-07-09
---
